  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to conjure spectral vines around nearby creatures. Each creature of your choice that you can see within 15 feet of yourself must succeed on a Strength saving throw or have the Restrained condition for 1 minute. A Restrained creature repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p><section id=\"secret-0hFWoWfW8qGxYckC\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which applies the Restrained condition.</p></section>",
